    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1852180/extras/64756703b031f8f659b19b4bc4a09ef2.avif?t=1675084990\" /></div><br><br>Undercraft is a sandbox game set in a procedurally generated world. Have different experiences every time you play the game. Explore this vast world.<br><br>Game Features:<br>- Travel through this medieval fantasy world<br>- Generate your world procedurally<br>- Fight against Goblins and Skeletons of different types<br>- Craft various items to survive<br>- Build your own house to survive<br>- Take care with the passing of day to night<br>- Swim and dive in ocean waters for survival<br>- Collect various resources across the map<br>- Make different types of weapons to survive<br>- Dig a hole anywhere in the ground and create houses inside it to survive<br>- Help Villagers in case they need help<br>- Punitive combat system, block, attack. Use your creativity to fight the enemy<br>- Wander through the biomes and find different resources, enemies, and people.<br>- Manage your stats if you want to survive, don't go hungry or dehydrated.<br>- And many more updates to come. Stay Tuned!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1852180/extras/a2773ef97fda71a01c11b08538e2c4ee.avif?t=1675084990\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1852180/extras/64756703b031f8f659b19b4bc4a09ef2.avif?t=1675084990\" /></div><br><br>Undercraft is a sandbox game set in a procedurally generated world. Have different experiences every time you play the game. Explore this vast world.<br><br>Game Features:<br>- Travel through this medieval fantasy world<br>- Generate your world procedurally<br>- Fight against Goblins and Skeletons of different types<br>- Craft various items to survive<br>- Build your own house to survive<br>- Take care with the passing of day to night<br>- Swim and dive in ocean waters for survival<br>- Collect various resources across the map<br>- Make different types of weapons to survive<br>- Dig a hole anywhere in the ground and create houses inside it to survive<br>- Help Villagers in case they need help<br>- Punitive combat system, block, attack. Use your creativity to fight the enemy<br>- Wander through the biomes and find different resources, enemies, and people.<br>- Manage your stats if you want to survive, don't go hungry or dehydrated.<br>- And many more updates to come. Stay Tuned!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1852180/extras/a2773ef97fda71a01c11b08538e2c4ee.avif?t=1675084990\" /></div>",
